; A trailing dot states no fraction digits, and unary signs may repeat or
; be followed by spaces.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B

2020-01-02 * "Trailing dot"
  Assets:A  5. USD
  Assets:A  1,000. USD
  Assets:B

2020-01-03 * "Repeated and spaced signs"
  Assets:A  --1 USD
  Assets:A  +-2 USD
  Assets:A  - 3 USD
  Assets:B

2020-01-04 balance Assets:A 1001 USD
